Do not add THE CHOIR, THE CURATOR, MATRON-V, WARDEN PRIME, or a full campaign. HELIX-04 is the only new boss in this phase.

The deliverable is a complete, testable prototype encounter, not merely a boss model, a health bar, or a visually impressive attack animation.

